Z||000007||Oreif||06-20-2000||02:50 AM||||Bam-Bam,<BR>You can get the IMSA body kit from IRM for $3500 or from The below link. They call it an SD4 body but it is the same as IRM's on  Archies.<BR>Just for Info Archie is selling the car. See his website for more details.<P>SD4 body kit at: (price is unknown)<BR> <A HREF="http://www.showcars-bodyparts.com/fiero.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.showcars-bodyparts.com/fiero.html</A> <P>Dan ~ Originally The IMSA body kit was made by Diversified Glass specifically for the Fiero Race Teams. When DG went out of the Fiero Business they sold the molds to IRM.<BR>IRM then sold them to everyone.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 06-20-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000008||Raydar||06-20-2000||01:39 PM||||If anybody cares...<BR>There were actually two designs of this spoiler.<BR>The first design only came down to the lock cylinder, in the rear. Had a small notch cut out, for clearance.<BR>The second design (like MrFixit's) came all the way to the bottom of the deck lid, with a hole drilled for access to the lock. <P>Just a bit of useless trivia.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
